  <p id="c-chenshu-017-appraisal-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：<persName id="c-chenshu-017-appraisal-complete:p001:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA">王沖</persName>、<persName id="c-chenshu-017-appraisal-complete:p001:m0007" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">王通</persName>嵭以貴游早升清貫，而允蹈禮節，篤誠奉上，斯為美焉。<persName id="c-chenshu-017-appraisal-complete:p001:m0034" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG">王勱</persName>之襟神夷澹，<persName id="c-chenshu-017-appraisal-complete:p001:m0042" ref="hb9_2gq_205_AA">袁樞</persName>之端操沉冥，雖拘放為異，而勝躯一揆，古所謂名士者，蓋在其人乎！</p>
</text>
